silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_02_yoneda_lemma_statement_concrete_anchor#idarrow_mittenscolimitapex silm:hasLongDescription "The IdArrow_MittensColimitApex is IdArrow_MittensColimitApex: the identity arrow on MittensColimitApex; the element in Hom(MittensColimitApex, MittensColimitApex) that the Yoneda bijection phi uses to evaluate a natural transformation tau at the apex: phi(tau) = tau_{MittensColimitApex}(id_{MittensColimitApex})." .
